## The model itself

- Base 484, highest score 652; lines: bureau_file, enquiries_6m,
  bureau_score, oldest_account_months, address_months, dti,
  income, revolving_utilisation, revolving_balance,
  worst_status_24m.
## Calibration and use as a probability

- The scale is not a PD. First-year PD = 1 / (1 + exp(-(20.456
  -0.0412 x score))), method platt.
